    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d26">

                <pb facs="0101" n="25" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg25"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 810.51/695</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador of Argentina
                    </hi><anchor n="7" xml:id="d26-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 3, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Acting Secretary of State presents his compliments to his excellency the
                    Ambassador of the Argentine Republic and, at the request <pb facs="0102" n="26"
                        xml:id="pg26"/> of the Secretary of the Treasury, has the honor to enclose
                    for the Ambassador’s information two brief printed memoranda summarizing the
                    accomplishments of the meeting of the Central Executive Council and of the
                    United States Section of the International High Commission on the fifteenth of
                    June.</p>




                <xi:include href="d26-a1.xml" xpointer="d26-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d26-a2.xml" xpointer="d26-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d26-f1" n="7" type="source" xml:id="d26-f1-content">
                <p>The same, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, to the other Latin
                    American missions at Washington.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
